  uniqueName: 13
  dialogue_phrases:
  - portraits: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8e78f8b2b22c138418b82972c188c268, type: 3}
    dialogueTexts: "A riddle you say? Hmm\u2026 One must seek into history to learn
      the answers of the future. Head to the tomb of Arrhonax, North of town. Maybe
      there you can find the answer you seek. Go then and keep me updated."
  - portraits: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8e78f8b2b22c138418b82972c188c268, type: 3}
    dialogueTexts: " I will speak with His Lordship on this\u2026 yes, this and The
      Horror\u2026 Most interesting\u2026 What? Get a move on, are you adventurers
      or just mannequins of such?! Go to the tomb!"
  journalEnter: "It was understood a meeting to the king would be arranged after
    completing the trial. Is the trial not over? Has Hitherin forgotten the rules
    of the arrangement? Fine, regardless of his insanity, curiosity must be sated.
    The talk of Horrors and a tomb\u2026 and what\u2019s behind that door? Curiosity
    is all overcome and the next goal is clear, onwards to the tomb of Arrhonax."
